questions.q:
Plan a wall chart titled 'How a Village Governs Itself' for your classroom. Say what the chart will show under each heading:
(a) two reasons why even a small village needs a government close by;
(b) which tier is closest to the people;
(c) four areas of responsibility, each with a village example of your own;
(d) the three vital roles of Panchayats;
(e) why the system is called self-government.
